# the control for the exit code above: a malformed coordinate is the invocation being wrong, and stays 20. Without this case, moving every capability refusal to 4 would look right.
$ kanonarion capability not-a-coordinate
exit 20
--- error ---
execute root command: invalid coordinate "not-a-coordinate": expected module@version, got "not-a-coordinate"
